contravenes s 229(4)
====================

3 ways this can be satisfied.

  1. An officer or employee of a corporation shall not makes improper use of his position as such an officer or employee, an advantage for himself
  2. An officer or employee of a corporation shall not makes improper use of his position as such an officer or employee, an advantage for any other person
  3. An officer or employee of a corporation shall not makes improper use of his position as such an officer or employee, detriment to the corporation
